{
  "name": "progressive rendering · 绝对路径指向不存在的数据",
  "description": "验证规范原文明文条款：'Note that components may reference children or data bindings that do not yet exist; clients should handle this gracefully by rendering placeholders (progressive rendering).'（a2ui_protocol.md §updateComponents）。用例使用规范合法的绝对路径（/ 开头），但故意指向 dataModel 中不存在的 key，验证 renderer 以占位形式优雅降级。dataModel 只提供 /present，其它引用的 /missing/*、/nowhere 完全缺席。期望渲染：t_present 显示 'HELLO'；其余三条 Text 平静渲染为空占位或 '[]'（stringifyForInterpolation 对 undefined 返回 ''）；formatString 中缺失路径也应被 '' 替代（对应规范 §formatString type conversion：'Null/Undefined: An empty string ""'）。绝不能显示 'undefined' / 'null' 字面量，绝不能 crash。",
  "messages": [
    {
      "version": "v0.9",
      "createSurface": {
        "surfaceId": "db-pr-4",
        "catalogId": "https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/catalogs/basic/catalog.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "version": "v0.9",
      "updateComponents": {
        "surfaceId": "db-pr-4",
        "components": [
          { "id": "root", "component": "Card", "child": "col" },
          {
            "id": "col",
            "component": "Column",
            "children": [
              "title",
              "label_present", "t_present",
              "label_missing_shallow", "t_missing_shallow",
              "label_missing_deep", "t_missing_deep",
              "label_mixed", "t_mixed",
              "footer"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "title",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "绝对路径指向不存在数据：规范要求 placeholder 降级",
            "variant": "h5"
          },
          {
            "id": "label_present",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "① 存在路径 /present：",
            "variant": "caption"
          },
          {
            "id": "t_present",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": { "path": "/present" }
          },
          {
            "id": "label_missing_shallow",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "② 顶层不存在 /nowhere：",
            "variant": "caption"
          },
          {
            "id": "t_missing_shallow",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": { "path": "/nowhere" }
          },
          {
            "id": "label_missing_deep",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "③ 深层不存在 /missing/user/name：",
            "variant": "caption"
          },
          {
            "id": "t_missing_deep",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": { "path": "/missing/user/name" }
          },
          {
            "id": "label_mixed",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "④ formatString 混合已存在与不存在：",
            "variant": "caption"
          },
          {
            "id": "t_mixed",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": {
              "call": "formatString",
              "args": {
                "value": "present=[${/present}] missing=[${/nowhere}] deep=[${/missing/user/name}]"
              },
              "returnType": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "footer",
            "component": "Text",
            "text": "期望：① 显示 HELLO；②③ 空占位；④ 显示 present=[HELLO] missing=[] deep=[]。绝不能出现 'undefined'/'null' 字面量。",
            "variant": "caption"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "version": "v0.9",
      "updateDataModel": {
        "surfaceId": "db-pr-4",
        "value": {
          "present": "HELLO"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
